'''En Garde Shrine''' (アンガード大魔宮 ''Angādo Daimakyū'', '''Un-Guard Great Demon Palace''') is the 17th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 115th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
None of these stages are particularly hard. [[Obvious Cache]] is incredibly easy due to most of its enemies having no pushing power, while [[Tender Trap]], [[Auto-Walk Labyrinth]] and [[Cheerful Heretic]] are very simple in nature. [[Illuminated Trapdoor]] is more tedious than difficult, while [[Incompetent Watchman]] is ironically the one competent stage in this subchapter.

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Prof. Owlbrowley]]: A [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[Owlbrow]] that has a slightly slower attack rate, but higher heath, damage and speed and a 100% chance to freeze cats for 4 seconds. Stands at 360 range instead of 340, with Omni Strikes that extend their reach to 440.

