==Trivia==
*"En Garde" may be a mistranslation. The phrase ''En Garde'' transliterated into Japanese would be アン・ガルド ''An・Garudo'', but the sub-chapter's Japanese name uses アンガード ''Angādo'', which can be taken as "Enguard" or more relevantly "Un-Guard", referencing the lack of security indicated by most of the stages' names.

